## 3. Academic Integrity & Coursework Notice

The materials in this repository represent university coursework, laboratory experiments, and study notes. They are shared openly for educational, self-study, and typesetting reference purposes only.

- If you are a student enrolled in similar courses, you are encouraged to study the concepts and typesetting approaches.
- Do not submit any part of this work as your own. Plagiarism violates academic honor codes and university conduct policies.
- Problem statements, syllabus prompts, or curriculum guidelines belong to their respective academic institutions and professors; the licenses herein apply to original solutions, explanatory text, code, diagrams, and typesetting implementations.
